# scenario: retry-in-start
# doc: retry-in-start.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude retry-in-start.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: start returns retry with one extra attempt before any provider launched, so pre-flight re-runs (attempt 2) without initialize or finalize
# given: the second start's retry finds the budget spent and the run continues to launch
# given: launch 1 exits 0 with a result
event initialize
event start
event start
work fresh 0
event success
event finalize
err none
exit 0
